//igraph.org/c/html/latest/igraph-Data-structures.html#igraph_vector_init\"><code>igraph_vector_init</code></a>).</p>\n<h5 id=\"panics\"><a class=\"doc-anchor\" href=\"#panics\">§</a>Panics</h5>\n<p>If igraph cannot allocate the vector, or <code>len</code> does not fit in\nan <code>i64</code>, like <a href=\"https://doc.rust-lang.org/1.98.1/alloc/vec/struct.Vec.html#method.with_capacity\" title=\"associated function alloc::vec::Vec::with_capacity\"><code>Vec::with_capacity</code></a>.</p>\n</div></details><details class=\"toggle method-toggle deprecated\" open><summary><section id=\"method.with_capacity\" class=\"method\"><a class=\"src rightside\" href=\"src/igraph/vector.rs.html#455-466\">Source</a><h4 class=\"code-header\">pub fn <a href=\"#method.with_capacity\" class=\"fn\">with_capacity</a>(size: <a class=\"primitive\" href=\"https://doc.rust-lang.org/1.98.1/std/primitive.usize.html\">usize</a>) -&gt; Self</h4></section><span class=\"item-info\"><div class=\"stab deprecated\"><span class=\"emoji\">👎</span><span>Deprecated: <p>it creates a zero-filled vector of length <code>size</code>: use <code>zeros</code></p>\n</span></div></span></summary><div class=\"docblock\"><p>Creates a vector of <code>len</code> zero (default) elements.</p>\n</div></details><details class=\"toggle method-toggle\" open><summary><section id=\"method.from_slice\" class=\"method\"><a class=\"src rightside\" href=\"src/igraph/vector.rs.html#455-466\">Source</a><h4 class=\"code-header\">pub fn <a href=\"#method.from_slice\" class=\"fn\">from_slice</a>(data: &amp;[<a class=\"type\" href=\"igraph/ffi/type.igraph_bool_t.html\" title=\"type igraph::ffi::igraph_bool_t\">igraph_bool_t</a>]) -&gt; Self</h4></section></summary><div class=\"docblock\"><p>Creates a vector by copying the elements of a slice\n(<a href=\"https://igraph.org/c/html/latest/igraph-Data-structures.html#igraph_vector_init_array\"><code>igraph_vector_init_array</code></a>).</p>\n</div></details><details class=\"toggle method-toggle\" open><summary><section id=\"method.view\" class=\"method\"><a class=\"src rightside\" href=\"src/igraph/vector.rs.html#455-466\">Source</a><h4 class=\"code-header\">pub fn <a href=\"#method.view\" class=\"fn\">view</a>(data: &amp;[<a class=\"type\" href=\"igraph/ffi/type.igraph_bool_t.html\" title=\"type igraph::ffi::igraph_bool_t\">igraph_bool_t</a>]) -&gt; <a class=\"struct\" href=\"igraph/vector/struct.View.html\" title=\"struct igraph::vector::View\">View</a>&lt;'_, Self&gt;</h4></section></summary><div class=\"docblock\"><p>Creates a read-only view of <code>data</code>, without copying it\n(<a href=\"https://igraph.org/c/html/latest/igraph-Data-structures.html#igraph_vector_view\"><code>igraph_vector_view</code></a>); the view\ndereferences to this vector type and never frees <code>data</code>.</p>\n</div></details><details class=\"toggle method-toggle\" open><summary><section id=\"method.size\" class=\"method\"><a class=\"src rightside\" href=\"src/igraph/vector.rs.html#455-466\">Source</a><h4 class=\"code-header\">pub fn <a href=\"#method.size\" class=\"fn\">size</a>(&amp;self) -&gt; <a class=\"primitive\" href=\"https://doc.rust-lang.org/1.98.1/std/primitive.usize.html\">usize</a></h4></section></summary><div class=\"docblock\"><p>Number of elements (also available through <a href=\"https://doc.rust-lang.org/1.98.1/core/ops/deref/trait.Deref.html\" title=\"trait core::ops::deref::Deref\"><code>Deref</code></a> as <code>len</code>).</p>\n</div></details><details class=\"toggle method-toggle\" open><summary><section id=\"method.as_slice\" class=\"method\"><a class=\"src rightside\" href=\"src/igraph/vector.rs.html#455-466\">Source</a><h4 class=\"code-header\">pub fn <a href=\"#method.as_slice\" class=\"fn\">as_slice</a>(&amp;self) -&gt; &amp;[<a class=\"type\" href=\"igraph/ffi/type.igraph_bool_t.html\" title=\"type igraph::ffi::igraph_bool_t\">igraph_bool_t</a>] <a href=\"#\" class=\"tooltip\" data-notable-ty=\"&amp;[igraph_bool_t]\">ⓘ</a></h4></section></summary><div class=\"docblock\"><p>The elements as a slice.</p>\n</div></details><details class=\"toggle method-toggle\" open><summary><section id=\"method.as_mut_slice\" class=\"method\"><a class=\"src rightside\" href=\"src/igraph/vector.rs.html#455-466\">Source</a><h4 class=\"code-header\">pub fn <a href=\"#method.as_mut_slice\" class=\"fn\">as_mut_slice</a>(&amp;mut self) -&gt; &amp;mut [<a class=\"type\" href=\"igraph/ffi/type.igraph_bool_t.html\" title=\"type igraph::ffi::igraph_bool_t\">igraph_bool_t</a>] <a href=\"#\" class=\"tooltip\" data-notable-ty=\"&amp;mut [igraph_bool_t]\">ⓘ</a></h4></section></summary><div class=\"docblock\"><p>The elements as a mutable slice.</p>\n</div></details><details class=\"toggle method-toggle\" open><summary><section id=\"method.push\" class=\"method\"><a class=\"src rightside\" href=\"src/igraph/vector.rs.html#455-466\">Source</a><h4 class=\"code-header\">pub fn <a href=\"#method.push\" class=\"fn\">push</a>(&amp;mut self, value: <a class=\"type\" href=\"igraph/ffi/type.igraph_bool_t.html\" title=\"type igraph::ffi::igraph_bool_t\">igraph_bool_t</a>)</h4></section></summary><div class=\"docblock\"><p>Appends an element at the end, in amortized O(1)\n(<a href=\"https://igraph.org/c/html/latest/igraph-Data-structures.html#igraph_vector_push_back\"><code>igraph_vector_push_back</code></a>).</p>\n</div></details><details class=\"toggle method-toggle\" open><summary><section id=\"method.pop\" class=\"method\"><a class=\"src rightside\" href=\"src/igraph/vector.rs.html#455-466\">Source</a><h4 class=\"code-header\">pub fn <a href=\"#method.pop\" class=\"fn\">pop</a>(&amp;mut self) -&gt; <a class=\"enum\" href=\"https://doc.rust-lang.org/1.98.1/core/option/enum.Option.html\" title=\"enum core::option::Option\">Option</a>&lt;<a class=\"type\" href=\"igraph/ffi/type.igraph_bool_t.html\" title=\"type igraph::ffi::igraph_bool_t\">igraph_bool_t</a>&gt;</h4></section></summary><div class=\"docblock\"><p>Removes and returns the last element, if any.</p>\n</div></details><details class=\"toggle method-toggle\" open><summary><section id=\"method.truncate\" class=\"method\"><a class=\"src rightside\" href=\"src/igraph/vector.rs.html#455-466\">Source</a><h4 class=\"code-header\">pub fn <a href=\"#method.truncate\" class=\"fn\">truncate</a>(&amp;mut self, len: <a class=\"primitive\" href=\"https://doc.rust-lang.org/1.98.1/std/primitive.usize.html\">usize</a>)</h4></section></summary><div class=\"docblock\"><p>Shortens the vector to <code>len</code> elements (no-op if already shorter).</p>\n</div></details><details class=\"toggle method-toggle\" open><summary><section id=\"method.clear\" class=\"method\"><a class=\"src rightside\" href=\"src/igraph/vector.rs.html#455-466\">Source</a><h4 class=\"code-header\">pub fn <a href=\"#method.clear\" class=\"fn\">clear</a>(&amp;mut self)</h4></section></summary><div class=\"docblock\"><p>Removes all the elements, keeping the allocated storage.</p>\n</div></details><details class=\"toggle method-toggle\" open><summary><section id=\"method.resize\" class=\"method\"><a class=\"src rightside\" href=\"src/igraph/vector.rs.html#455-466\">Source</a><h4 class=\"code-header\">pub fn <a href=\"#method.resize\" class=\"fn\">resize</a>(&amp;mut self, len: <a class=\"primitive\" href=\"https://doc.rust-lang.org/1.98.1/std/primitive.usize.html\">usize</a>)</h4></section></summary><div class=\"docblock\"><p>Resizes the vector to <code>len</code> elements\n(<a href=\"https://igraph.org/c/html/latest/igraph-Data-structures.html#igraph_vector_resize\"><code>igraph_vector_resize</code></a>); new\nelements are unspecified by igraph, so this wrapper zeroes them.</p>\n</div></details><details class=\"toggle method-toggle\" open><summary><section id=\"method.reserve\" class=\"method\"><a class=\"src rightside\" href=\"src/igraph/vector.rs.html#455-466\">Source</a><h4 class=\"code-header\">pub fn <a href=\"#method.reserve\" class=\"fn\">reserve</a>(&amp;mut self, capacity: <a class=\"primitive\" href=\"https://doc.rust-lang.org/1.98.1/std/primitive.usize.html\">usize</a>)</h4></section></summary><div class=\"docblock\"><p>Reserves storage for at least <code>capacity</code> elements in total\n(<a href=\"https://igraph.org/c/html/latest/igraph-Data-structures.html#igraph_vector_reserve\"><code>igraph_vector_reserve</code></a>).</p>\n</div></details><details class=\"toggle method-toggle\" open><summary><section id=\"method.to_vec\" class=\"method\"><a class=\"src rightside\" href=\"src/igraph/vector.rs.html#455-466\">Source</a><h4 class=\"code-header\">pub fn <a href=\"#method.to_vec\" class=\"fn\">to_vec</a>(&amp;self) -&gt; <a class=\"struct\" href=\"https://doc.rust-lang.org/1.98.1/alloc/vec/struct.Vec.html\" title=\"struct alloc::vec::Vec\">Vec</a>&lt;<a class=\"type\" href=\"igraph/ffi/type.igraph_bool_t.html\" title=\"type igraph::ffi::igraph_bool_t\">igraph_bool_t</a>&gt; <a href=\"#\" class=\"tooltip\" data-notable-ty=\"Vec&lt;igraph_bool_t&gt;\">ⓘ</a></h4></section></summary><div class=\"docblock\"><p>Copies the elements into a <a href=\"https://doc.rust-lang.org/1.98.1/alloc/vec/struct.Vec.html\" title=\"struct alloc::vec::Vec\"><code>Vec</code></a>.</p>\n</div></details></div></details>",0,"igraph::vector::VectorBool"],["<details class=\"toggle implementors-toggle\" open><summary><section id=\"impl-igraph_vector_bool_t\" class=\"impl\"><a class=\"src rightside\" href=\"src/igraph/vector.rs.html#827-842\">Source</a><a href=\"#impl-igraph_vector_bool_t\" class=\"anchor\">§</a><h3 class=\"code-header\">impl <a class=\"struct\" href=\"igraph/ffi/struct.igraph_vector_bool_t.html\" title=\"struct igraph::ffi::igraph_vector_bool_t\">igraph_vector_bool_t</a></h3></section></summary><div class=\"impl-items\"><details class=\"toggle method-toggle\" open><summary><section id=\"method.insert\" class=\"method\"><a class=\"src rightside\" href=\"src/igraph/vector.rs.html#827-842\">Source</a><h4 class=\"code-header\">pub fn <a href=\"#method.insert\" class=\"fn\">insert</a>(&amp;mut self, pos: <a class=\"primitive\" href=\"https://doc.rust-lang.org/1.98.1/std/primitive.usize.html\">usize</a>, value: <a class=\"type\" href=\"igraph/ffi/type.igraph_bool_t.html\" title=\"type igraph::ffi::igraph_bool_t\">igraph_bool_t</a>)</h4></section></summary><div class=\"docblock\"><p>Inserts <code>value</code> at position <code>pos</code>, shifting the following\nelements to the right, like <a href=\"https://doc.rust-lang.org/1.98.1/alloc/vec/struct.Vec.html#method.insert\" title=\"method alloc::vec::Vec::insert\"><code>Vec::insert</code></a>\n(<a href=\"https://igraph.org/c/html/latest/igraph-Data-structures.html#igraph_vector_insert\"><code>igraph_vector_insert</code></a>).</p>\n<h5 id=\"panics\"><a class=\"doc-anchor\" href=\"#panics\">§</a>Panics</h5>\n<p>If <code>pos &gt; len</code>.</p>\n</div></details><details class=\"toggle method-toggle\" open><summary><section id=\"method.remove\" class=\"method\"><a class=\"src rightside\" href=\"src/igraph/vector.rs.html#827-842\">Source</a><h4 class=\"code-header\">pub fn <a href=\"#method.remove\" class=\"fn\">remove</a>(&amp;mut self, pos: <a class=\"primitive\" href=\"https://doc.rust-lang.org/1.98.1/std/primitive.usize.html\">usize</a>) -&gt; <a class=\"type\" href=\"igraph/ffi/type.igraph_bool_t.html\" title=\"type igraph::ffi::igraph_bool_t\">igraph_bool_t</a></h4></section></summary><div class=\"docblock\"><p>Removes and returns the element at <code>pos</code>, shifting the\nfollowing ones to the left, like <a href=\"https://doc.rust-lang.org/1.98.1/alloc/vec/struct.Vec.html#method.remove\" title=\"method alloc::vec::Vec::remove\"><code>Vec::remove</code></a>\n(<a href=\"https://igraph.org/c/html/latest/igraph-Data-structures.html#igraph_vector_remove\"><code>igraph_vector_remove</code></a>).</p>\n<h5 id=\"panics-1\"><a class=\"doc-anchor\" href=\"#panics-1\">§</a>Panics</h5>\n<p>If <code>pos &gt;= len</code>.</p>\n</div></details><details class=\"toggle method-toggle\" open><summary><section id=\"method.swap_remove\" class=\"method\"><a class=\"src rightside\" href=\"src/igraph/vector.rs.html#827-842\">Source</a><h4 class=\"code-header\">pub fn <a href=\"#method.swap_remove\" class=\"fn\">swap_remove</a>(&amp;mut self, pos: <a class=\"primitive\" href=\"https://doc.rust-lang.org/1.98.1/std/primitive.usize.html\">usize</a>) -&gt; <a class=\"type\" href=\"igraph/ffi/type.igraph_bool_t.html\" title=\"type igraph::ffi::igraph_bool_t\">igraph_bool_t</a></h4></section></summary><div class=\"docblock\"><p>Removes the element at <code>pos</code> in O(1) by moving the last\nelement into its place, like <a href=\"https://doc.rust-lang.org/1.98.1/alloc/vec/struct.Vec.html#method.swap_remove\" title=\"method alloc::vec::Vec::swap_remove\"><code>Vec::swap_remove</code></a>\n(<code>igraph_vector_remove_fast</code>, undocumented in <code>igraph_vector.h</code>).</p>\n<h5 id=\"panics-2\"><a class=\"doc-anchor\" href=\"#panics-2\">§</a>Panics</h5>\n<p>If <code>pos &gt;= len</code>.</p>\n</div></details><details class=\"toggle method-toggle\" open><summary><section id=\"method.remove_section\" class=\"method\"><a class=\"src rightside\" href=\"src/igraph/vector.rs.html#827-842\">Source</a><h4 class=\"code-header\">pub fn <a href=\"#method.remove_section\" class=\"fn\">remove_section</a>(&amp;mut self, range: <a class=\"struct\" href=\"https://doc.rust-lang.org/1.98.1/core/ops/range/struct.Range.html\" title=\"struct core::ops::range::Range\">Range</a>&lt;<a class=\"primitive\" href=\"https://doc.rust-lang.org/1.98.1/std/primitive.usize.html\">usize</a>&gt;)</h4></section></summary><div class=\"docblock\"><p>Removes the elements in <code>range</code>\n(<a href=\"https://igraph.org/c/html/latest/igraph-Data-structures.html#igraph_vector_remove_section\"><code>igraph_vector_remove_section</code></a>).</p>\n<h5 id=\"panics-3\"><a class=\"doc-anchor\" href=\"#panics-3\">§</a>Panics</h5>\n<p>If the range is decreasing or goes past the end.</p>\n</div></details><details class=\"toggle method-toggle\" open><summary><section id=\"method.extend_from_slice\" class=\"method\"><a class=\"src rightside\" href=\"src/igraph/vector.rs.html#827-842\">Source</a><h4 class=\"code-header\">pub fn <a href=\"#method.extend_from_slice\" class=\"fn\">extend_from_slice</a>(&amp;mut self, other: &amp;[<a class=\"type\" href=\"igraph/ffi/type.igraph_bool_t.html\" title=\"type igraph::ffi::igraph_bool_t\">igraph_bool_t</a>])</h4></section></summary><div class=\"docblock\"><p>Appends a copy of all the elements of <code>other</code>\n(<a href=\"https://igraph.org/c/html/latest/igraph-Data-structures.html#igraph_vector_append\"><code>igraph_vector_append</code></a>).</p>\n</div></details><details class=\"toggle method-toggle\" open><summary><section id=\"method.shuffle\" class=\"method\"><a class=\"src rightside\" href=\"src/igraph/vector.rs.html#827-842\">Source</a><h4 class=\"code-header\">pub fn <a href=\"#method.shuffle\" class=\"fn\">shuffle</a>(&amp;mut self)</h4></section></summary><div class=\"docblock\"><p>Shuffles the elements in place with the Fisher-Yates algorithm,\ndrawing from igraph’s default random number generator, so the\noutcome is reproducible with <a href=\"igraph/rng/fn.seed.html\" title=\"fn igraph::rng::seed\"><code>rng::seed</code></a>\n(<a href=\"https://igraph.org/c/html/latest/igraph-Data-structures.html#igraph_vector_shuffle\"><code>igraph_vector_shuffle</code></a>).</p>\n\n<div class=\"example-wrap\"><pre class=\"rust rust-example-rendered\"><code><span class=\"kw\">use </span>igraph::prelude::<span class=\"kw-2\">*</span>;\nrng::seed(<span class=\"number\">42</span>).unwrap();\n<span class=\"kw\">let </span><span class=\"kw-2\">mut </span>deck: VectorInt = (<span class=\"number\">0</span>..<span class=\"number\">52</span>).collect();\ndeck.shuffle();\n<span class=\"kw\">let </span><span class=\"kw-2\">mut </span>again: VectorInt = (<span class=\"number\">0</span>..<span class=\"number\">52</span>).collect();\nrng::seed(<span class=\"number\">42</span>).unwrap();\nagain.shuffle();\n<span class=\"macro\">assert_eq!</span>(deck, again);\ndeck.sort();\n<span class=\"macro\">assert_eq!</span>(deck, (<span class=\"number\">0</span>..<span class=\"number\">52</span>).collect::&lt;Vec&lt;i64&gt;&gt;());</code></pre></div></div></details><details class=\"toggle method-toggle\" open><summary><section id=\"method.permute\" class=\"method\"><a class=\"src rightside\" href=\"src/igraph/vector.rs.html#827-842\">Source</a><h4 class=\"code-header\">pub fn <a href=\"#method.permute\" class=\"fn\">permute</a>(&amp;mut self, index: &amp;[<a class=\"type\" href=\"igraph/ffi/type.igraph_int_t.html\" title=\"type igraph::ffi::igraph_int_t\">igraph_int_t</a>]) -&gt; <a class=\"type\" href=\"igraph/error/type.Result.html\" title=\"type igraph::error::Result\">Result</a>&lt;<a class=\"primitive\" href=\"https://doc.rust-lang.org/1.98.1/std/primitive.unit.html\">()</a>&gt;</h4></section></summary><div class=\"docblock\"><p>Permutes the elements in place so that the element at position\n<code>index[i]</code> moves to position <code>i</code>, with the semantics of\n<a href=\"https://igraph.org/c/html/latest/igraph-Data-structures.html#igraph_vector_permute\"><code>igraph_vector_permute</code></a>.</p>\n<p>The index is compatible with the one returned by <code>sort_ind</code>:\npermuting by it sorts the vector. If <code>index</code> is <em>shorter</em> than\nthe vector, the elements not mentioned are dropped.</p>\n<h5 id=\"errors\"><a class=\"doc-anchor\" href=\"#errors\">§</a>Errors</h5>\n<p><a href=\"igraph/error/enum.ErrorKind.html#variant.InvalidValue\" title=\"variant igraph::error::ErrorKind::InvalidValue\"><code>ErrorKind::InvalidValue</code></a>\nif <code>index</code> has out-of-range or repeated positions.</p>\n</div></details><details class=\"toggle method-toggle\" open><summary><section id=\"method.select\" class=\"method\"><a class=\"src rightside\" href=\"src/igraph/vector.rs.html#827-842\">Source</a><h4 class=\"code-header\">pub fn <a href=\"#method.select\" class=\"fn\">select</a>(&amp;self, index: &amp;[<a class=\"type\" href=\"igraph/ffi/type.igraph_int_t.html\" title=\"type igraph::ffi::igraph_int_t\">igraph_int_t</a>]) -&gt; <a class=\"type\" href=\"igraph/error/type.Result.html\" title=\"type igraph::error::Result\">Result</a>&lt;Self&gt;</h4></section></summary><div class=\"docblock\"><p>A new vector with the elements at the given positions, i.e.\n<code>result[i] = self[index[i]]</code>; positions may repeat\n(<a href=\"https://igraph.org/c/html/latest/igraph-Data-structures.html#igraph_vector_index\"><code>igraph_vector_index</code></a>).</p>\n<h5 id=\"errors-1\"><a class=\"doc-anchor\" href=\"#errors-1\">§</a>Errors</h5>\n<p><a href=\"igraph/error/enum.ErrorKind.html#variant.InvalidValue\" title=\"variant igraph::error::ErrorKind::InvalidValue\"><code>ErrorKind::InvalidValue</code></a>\nif some position is out of bounds.</p>\n</div></details><details class=\"toggle method-toggle\" open><summary><section id=\"method.search\" class=\"method\"><a class=\"src rightside\" href=\"src/igraph/vector.rs.html#827-842\">Source</a><h4 class=\"code-header\">pub fn <a href=\"#method.search\" class=\"fn\">search</a>(&amp;self, from: <a class=\"primitive\" href=\"https://doc.rust-lang.org/1.98.1/std/primitive.usize.html\">usize</a>, value: <a class=\"type\" href=\"igraph/ffi/type.igraph_bool_t.html\" title=\"type igraph::ffi::igraph_bool_t\">igraph_bool_t</a>) -&gt; <a class=\"enum\" href=\"https://doc.rust-lang.org/1.98.1/core/option/enum.Option.html\" title=\"enum core::option::Option\">Option</a>&lt;<a class=\"primitive\" href=\"https://doc.rust-lang.org/1.98.1/std/primitive.usize.html\">usize</a>&gt;</h4></section></summary><div class=\"docblock\"><p>Position of the first occurrence of <code>value</code> at or after <code>from</code>,\nif any (<a href=\"https://igraph.org/c/html/latest/igraph-Data-structures.html#igraph_vector_search\"><code>igraph_vector_search</code></a>).</p>\n</div></details><details class=\"toggle method-toggle\" open><summary><section id=\"method.capacity\" class=\"method\"><a class=\"src rightside\" href=\"src/igraph/vector.rs.html#827-842\">Source</a><h4 class=\"code-header\">pub fn <a href=\"#method.capacity\" class=\"fn\">capacity</a>(&amp;self) -&gt; <a class=\"primitive\" href=\"https://doc.rust-lang.org/1.98.1/std/primitive.usize.html\">usize</a></h4></section></summary><div class=\"docblock\"><p>Number of elements the vector can hold without reallocating\n(<a href=\"https://igraph.org/c/html/latest/igraph-Data-structures.html#igraph_vector_capacity\"><code>igraph_vector_capacity</code></a>).</p>\n</div></details><details class=\"toggle method-toggle\" open><summary><section id=\"method.shrink_to_fit\" class=\"method\"><a class=\"src rightside\" href=\"src/igraph/vector.rs.html#827-842\">Source</a><h4 class=\"code-header\">pub fn <a href=\"#method.shrink_to_fit\" class=\"fn\">shrink_to_fit</a>(&amp;mut self)</h4></section></summary><div class=\"docblock\"><p>Frees the unused storage, so that the capacity equals the\nlength (<a href=\"https://igraph.org/c/html/latest/igraph-Data-structures.html#igraph_vector_resize_min\"><code>igraph_vector_resize_min</code></a>).</p>\n</div></details><details class=\"toggle method-toggle\" open><summary><section id=\"method.move_interval\" class=\"method\"><a class=\"src rightside\" href=\"src/igraph/vector.rs.html#827-842\">Source</a><h4 class=\"code-header\">pub fn <a href=\"#method.move_interval\" class=\"fn\">move_interval</a>(&amp;mut self, src: <a class=\"struct\" href=\"https://doc.rust-lang.org/1.98.1/core/ops/range/struct.Range.html\" title=\"struct core::ops::range::Range\">Range</a>&lt;<a class=\"primitive\" href=\"https://doc.rust-lang.org/1.98.1/std/primitive.usize.html\">usize</a>&gt;, dest: <a class=\"primitive\" href=\"https://doc.rust-lang.org/1.98.1/std/primitive.usize.html\">usize</a>)</h4></section></summary><div class=\"docblock\"><p>Copies the elements in <code>src</code> to the position starting at\n<code>dest</code>, like <a href=\"https://doc.rust-lang.org/1.98.1/std/primitive.slice.html#method.copy_within\" title=\"method slice::copy_within\"><code>slice::copy_within</code></a>; the regions may overlap\n(<code>igraph_vector_move_interval</code>, undocumented in <code>igraph_vector.h</code>).</p>\n<h5 id=\"panics-4\"><a class=\"doc-anchor\" href=\"#panics-4\">§</a>Panics</h5>\n<p>If either region goes past the end of the vector.</p>\n</div></details><details class=\"toggle method-toggle\" open><summary><section id=\"method.get_interval\" class=\"method\"><a class=\"src rightside\" href=\"src/igraph/vector.rs.html#827-842\">Source</a><h4 class=\"code-header\">pub fn <a href=\"#method.get_interval\" class=\"fn\">get_interval</a>(&amp;self, range: <a class=\"struct\" href=\"https://doc.rust-lang.org/1.98.1/core/ops/range/struct.Range.html\" title=\"struct core::ops::range::Range\">Range</a>&lt;<a class=\"primitive\" href=\"https://doc.rust-lang.org/1.98.1/std/primitive.usize.html\">usize</a>&gt;) -&gt; Self</h4></section></summary><div class=\"docblock\"><p>A new vector with a copy of the elements in <code>range</code>\n(<code>igraph_vector_get_interval</code>, undocumented in <code>igraph_vector.h</code>).</p>\n<h5 id=\"panics-5\"><a class=\"doc-anchor\" href=\"#panics-5\">§</a>Panics</h5>\n<p>If the range goes past the end.</p>\n</div></details></div></details>",0,"igraph::vector::VectorBool"],["<section id=\"impl-Send-for-igraph_vector_bool_t\" class=\"impl\"><a class=\"src rightside\" href=\"src/igraph/vector.rs.html#455-466\">Source</a><a href=\"#impl-Send-for-igraph_vector_bool_t\" class=\"anchor\">§</a><h3 class=\"code-header\">impl <a class=\"trait\" href=\"https://doc.rust-lang.org/1.98.1/core/marker/trait.Send.html\" title=\"trait core::marker::Send\">Send</a> for <a class=\"struct\" href=\"igraph/ffi/struct.igraph_vector_bool_t.html\" title=\"struct igraph::ffi::igraph_vector_bool_t\">igraph_vector_bool_t</a></h3></section>","Send","igraph::vector::VectorBool"],["<section id=\"impl-Sync-for-igraph_vector_bool_t\" class=\"impl\"><a class=\"src rightside\" href=\"src/igraph/vector.rs.html#455-466\">Source</a><a href=\"#impl-Sync-for-igraph_vector_bool_t\" class=\"anchor\">§</a><h3 class=\"code-header\">impl <a class=\"trait\" href=\"https://doc.rust-lang.org/1.98.1/core/marker/trait.Sync.html\" title=\"trait core::marker::Sync\">Sync</a> for <a class=\"struct\" href=\"igraph/ffi/struct.igraph_vector_bool_t.html\" title=\"struct igraph::ffi::igraph_vector_bool_t\">igraph_vector_bool_t</a></h3></section>","Sync","igraph::vector::VectorBool"]]]]);
